				"aspect": "composition",
				"title": {
					"en": "A shallower architectural portrait",
					"zh": "更平的建筑视角"
				},
				"description": {
					"en": "The corner tower replaces the rejected plain stone slab. A three-quarter camera around 25 degrees above horizontal emphasizes its tiered eaves and compact foundation; the complete tower is uniformly inset without clipping finials or roof tips.",
					"zh": "角楼替换已否定的普通石砖。约 25° 俯视的斜向镜头突出重檐和紧凑基座；整座建筑统一缩放，尖顶与飞檐均完整保留。"
				}
			},
			{
				"aspect": "drawing",
				"title": {
					"en": "Obsidian and gemstones",
					"zh": "黑曜石与宝石"
				},
				"description": {
					"en": "Polished black obsidian defines the structure. Emerald roof inlays, restrained ruby accents, warm amber and fine gold trim follow the architecture as one coherent material system, with physical light and crisp high-resolution detail.",
					"zh": "抛光黑曜石构成建筑主体。祖母绿屋面、克制的红宝石点缀、温暖琥珀及细金边沿建筑组织为一个统一材质体系，保留真实光感与清晰高清细节。"
				}
			},
			{
				"aspect": "presentation",
				"title": {
					"en": "Corner tower construction grid",
					"zh": "角楼建筑工程格线"
				},
				"description": {
					"en": "Pale champagne drawing paper combines fine engineering cells, larger datum lines, sparse roof elevations and dimensional ticks. Its independent projected shadow creates a gentle hover gap under the obsidian foundation.",
					"zh": "浅香槟色制图纸结合细工程网格、较大的基准线、稀疏屋顶立面与尺寸刻度，独立投影在黑曜石基座下形成轻盈的悬浮间隙。"
				}
			}
		],
